# =====================================================================
#  CO2_PipeBreak — ZOOM BISECTION:  FIRST-ORDER wp (no BL-2 correction).
#  Target (MT-off) config, identical to inputs.satjet_zoom_nomt EXCEPT
#  ps_wp_order = 1.  Decisive test for the slug per-phase-energy pressure
#  ring:
#    - if the slug P odd-even COLLAPSES at 1st order  -> the BL-2 limited
#      correction flux breaks per-phase energy/mass consistency (fix there)
#    - if it PERSISTS at 1st order -> the base A±/A∓ deposit + alpha-frozen
#      transverse split is the seed (Abgrall interface-energy fix needed).
#  Short run to step 400 (t~2e-4), where the slug speckle is obvious.
# =====================================================================
